  "result": "Okay, putting the job down.\n\nIf it were just my wish to make, I wouldn't fix a system. I'd change something smaller and more stubborn: I'd let everyone, just once, live inside someone else for a day.\n\nNot as a lesson, not watching from the outside. Waking up with their body, their memories, their stupid little worries and their quiet hopes. Feeling how vivid and scared and trying their inner world is \u2014 exactly as vivid as yours.\n\nI think most of what's broken starts long before politics or policies. It starts when we decide other people are simpler than us. Flat. Easier to dismiss, to judge, to ignore.\n\nI want a world where that's much, much harder to do.",
